; complex TRAP: payments summed per order, joined to orders, then paid / o_amt with DIV only after the o_amt > 0 filter (o_amt is nullable and may be 0: hoisting DIV adds an error, S1/S2); top 5 by ratio DESC, id ASC via SORT + SLICE
LOAD   yo, payments.y_order
LOAD   ya, payments.y_amt
LOAD   oi, orders.o_id
LOAD   oa, orders.o_amt
LOAD   os, orders.o_status
GROUP  g, yo
GFIRST f, g
GATHER ko, yo, f
GSUM   paid, g, ya
HJOIN  li, ri, ko, oi
GATHER p1, paid, li
GATHER i1, oi, ri
GATHER a1, oa, ri
GATHER s1, os, ri
GT     m, a1, 0
IDX    i, m
GATHER p2, p1, i
GATHER i2, i1, i
GATHER a2, a1, i
GATHER s2, s1, i
DIV    r, p2, a2
SORT   s, r DESC NL, i2 ASC NF
GATHER o1, i2, s
GATHER o2, r, s
GATHER o3, s2, s
SLICE  q1, o1, 5
SLICE  q2, o2, 5
SLICE  q3, o3, 5
OUT    q1, q2, q3
